---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Affiliate disclosure | SaveAndPlay"
  description="How SaveAndPlay earns commissions from affiliate links, and what that means for the deals we show."
>
  <main class="page">
    <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
    <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: October 11, 2026</p>

    <div class="callout">
      <strong>In short:</strong> some links on SaveAndPlay are affiliate links. If you buy through them, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
    </div>

    <h2>How affiliate links work</h2>
    <p>SaveAndPlay takes part in affiliate programs run by game stores and affiliate networks. When you click a link to a store on our site and then make a purchase, the store may pay us a commission. The price you pay is the same as it would be without our link.</p>

    <h2>What this means for the deals we show</h2>
    <p>We aim to show real discounts from established stores. Commissions help pay for running the site. They don't change the prices you see, and we don't hide a good deal because a store doesn't pay us.</p>
    <p>Some links on the site may not be affiliate links. Where we can, we tell you which store a deal comes from, so you can check the offer yourself.</p>

    <h2 id="marketplaces">Marketplace keys (Kinguin) and key stores (Loaded)</h2>
    <p>Some deals link to a marketplace, where game keys are often sold by independent sellers and not by the store itself or the game's publisher. Right now this means Kinguin. These deals are marked <strong>Marketplace key</strong>, they are not official-store sales, and they come after the store sales on our lists.</p>
    <p>We never show the marketplace's own "discount". Instead we compare the key's price with the current Steam price in US dollars on the day we checked, and every card says so. Games that cost far less than on Steam are not shown at all, because a price that low is more likely to mean a problem than a bargain. We choose well-known games that Steam players rate highly. We may earn a commission from these links too.</p>
    <p>Keys from a marketplace come with extra risks. The seller may be a private person, a key can be limited to a region, a seller can cancel an order, and a key can be refused when you activate it. Check the seller's rating and the region on the marketplace page before you pay. If you want the safest route, buy from the official store. We don't call marketplace keys safe or official.</p>

    <p>Loaded is a key store, not a marketplace of independent sellers, but its keys are also not sold by Steam or by the game's publisher. These deals are marked <strong>Third-party key</strong> and treated the same way: we compare the price with the current Steam price, we show a key only when it is clearly cheaper, and we show the price for the US region as Loaded lists it. The region of the key itself may be different, so check the Loaded page and its terms before you pay. We may earn a commission from Loaded links too.</p>

    <h2>Prices and availability</h2>
    <p>Prices, discounts and offers change often. The price shown on SaveAndPlay may be out of date by the time you click. Always check the final price on the store's page before you buy. The store is responsible for the sale, delivery and support.</p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>If anything here is unclear, please <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
